Q: Ternary operators test case with jest A: <h2>Test both conditions:</h2>

<pre class="lang-js prettyprint-override"><code>  it('Should display the data if API status is complete', () =&gt; {
    const wrapper = shallowWithTheme(&lt;DataPage
